      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Loan (Local) (Amendment) Act 2005"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Loan (Local) (Amendment) Act 2005."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Loan (Local) Act 1959 [Act 637], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in section 4—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the shoulder note the following shoul der note: \"Sums charged on and payable out of Consolidated Fund\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(3) All expenditure in connection with the purchase, conversion and cancellation of stock made in accordance with this Act are charged upon and payable out of the Consolidated Fund.\". Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 5 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2) Any sum raised under this Act may be applied— (a) for the repayment or amortization of loans raised under this Act or any other written law; or (b) where a loan is raised by the issue of stock under this Act or any other written law, for the purchase or conversion of such stock.\". Amendment of heading of Part IV"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for the heading of Part IV the following heading: \"PART IV PROVISIONS RELATING TO REDEMPTION, PURCHASE, CONVERSION AND CANCELLATION OF STOCK AND CREATION OF SINKING FUND\". Amendment of section 11"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 11 the following section: \"11. (1) Stock issued under the provisions of this Act shall be redeemable at par— (a) on such dates as may be specified in the prospectus; or (b) where the prospectus provides that the stock is redeemable at the election of the Minister, on the earlier of the following dates: (i) the date of maturity; or (ii) the date of a call for redemption before maturity, to the extent to which such call is made, in accordance with the terms set out in the prospectus, after which dates all the interest on the principal moneys represented thereby shall cease and determine, whether payment of such principal moneys shall have been demanded or not. (2) Notwithstanding subsections 8A(5), 8B(4) and 11(1), where stock is redeemable at the election of the Minister and a call for redemption is made for only part of the stock, only such part of the stock as has been called for redemption shall be redeemable on the date of the call.\". New sections 11A and 11B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 11 the following sections: \"Power to purchase and cancel stock 11A. (1) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, purchase any stock, issued under section 6, held by any person subject to such price and such terms as may be allowed by the Minister. (2) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, cancel any stock purchased in accordance with subsection (1) upon such terms as may be allowed by the Minister. Power to convert stock 11B. (1) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, convert any stock or any part thereof, by exchanging such stock for any other stock, including new stock issued for the purposes of this section subject to such price and such terms as may be allowed by the Minister. (2) The Bank may, with the approval of the Minister, cancel any stock it has obtained under subsection (1) upon such terms as may be allowed by the Minister.\". Amendment of section 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 13 the following section: \"13. The sinking fund created under section 12 shall be applied— (a) firstly, for the payment of all expenses of, or incidental to, the management of the sinking fund and the redemption, purchase or conversion of the stock issued under this Act; (b) secondly, for the repayment of principal moneys represented by the stock; and (c) finally, for any purchase or conversion of stock under sections 11A and 11B.\". Amendment of section 14"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 14 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the word \"due\" the words \"or the purchase or conversion of stock under sections 11A and 11B\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
